<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia TV3 6-mth net at 9.84 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia TV3 6-mth net at 9.84 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Feb 28</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  9.84    vs	  19.79</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  5.0    vs	  12.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   141.65   vs	 106.82</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    15.02   vs	  26.55</p>
<p>    Minorities	   add   1.01   vs  less   0.12</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 3.0    vs	   6.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia Sistem Televisyen Malaysia Bhd is the operator of Malaysia's first private television station.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
